  {
   "id": "zephras-isle:107",
   "tags": {},
   "text": [
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Bugged: kill 8 Enchanted Skyhoppers as you cross Valanaar to the west side. They hop around Valennia (63-65, 76-79) and around Riaani on the west side (58-60, 74-77)."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Only the Enchanted ones count. Plain Skyhoppers look the same and give no credit (5 of 13 kills in the playtest were wasted on them). Both give only 5-7 XP, so don't hunt them; hit them on the way."
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
